  "html": "<div class=\"landing-slide slide-step-1 animate-slide\"><div class=\"slide-top-content marketing-slide-1\"><div class=\"hero-marketing-badge\"><div class=\"badge-logo-wrap\"><img alt=\"Amoriva\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" class=\"Amoriva-hero-icon\" src=\"/images/Amoriva-logo.png\"></div><div class=\"badge-text-col\"><span class=\"platform-tag\">\ud83c\udf0d Global Cultural &amp; Language Exchange</span><h3 class=\"platform-name\">Amoriva Official</h3></div></div><div class=\"marketing-features-grid\"><div class=\"marketing-feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-icon-box green-bg\">\ud83d\udcac</div><div class=\"feature-text\"><strong>Practice Through Conversation</strong><p>Have meaningful conversations with people from different countries and practice languages naturally.</p></div><span class=\"feature-rate-pill\">Language</span></div><div class=\"marketing-feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-icon-box teal-bg\">\ud83c\udf0e</div><div class=\"feature-text\"><strong>Discover New Cultures</strong><p>Learn about traditions, lifestyles, food, languages and everyday life from people around the world.</p></div><span class=\"feature-rate-pill\">Explore</span></div><div class=\"marketing-feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-icon-box orange-bg\">\ud83e\udd1d</div><div class=\"feature-text\"><strong>Meet International People</strong><p>Connect with members from different backgrounds who are interested in friendly cultural conversations.</p></div><span class=\"feature-rate-pill\">Connect</span></div></div></div><div class=\"slide-bottom-content\"><h1 class=\"slide-main-heading\">Connect, Exchange &amp;<br>Discover New Cultures</h1><p class=\"slide-main-subtext\">Chat about languages, culture and everyday life with international members from around the world.</p><div class=\"slide-pagination-dots\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pag-dot active\" aria-label=\"Slide 1\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pag-dot\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\"></button><button type=\"butt